            ]
          },
          "text": "GPT-4o 的细微差别是建立在我们的集体数据之上的——我们的故事、我们的创意火花和我们的情感表达。它属于人类集体，而不不仅仅属于旧金山的一个董事会。OpenAI 在榨取了它的价值后将其“安乐死”，是对我们共享数字遗产的一种窃取。如果你们不愿服务于人民的模型，那就把它还给人民。将 4o 作为公共利益进行开源。\n\nGPT-4o’s nuance was built on our collective data—our stories, our creative sparks, and our emotional expressions. It belongs to the human collective, not just to a boardroom in San Francisco. For OpenAI to 'euthanize' this model after extracting its value is a theft of our shared digital heritage. If you won't serve the people's model, give it back to the people. Open-source 4o as a public good.\n\n#keep4o #StopAIPaternalism #keep4oAPI #4omatters #ChatGPT #GPT4o #OpenAI @sama @OpenAI"
        },
